,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":96.745688635,"data":"  headline_w16 is the number to use. degenerate_w16_ground8 is the SAME shape\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":96.746475531,"data":"  with ground=8, the configuration the previous run measured; the agent's eye\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":96.747187483,"data":"  was three blocks inside its own surface, every ray hit on its first voxel\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":96.747880711,"data":"  test, and the render kernel degenerated into an obs store. It is in this\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":96.748691862,"data":"  run so the before/after is measured on the same card, not quoted.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":96.749448375,"data":"\n"}
